#1500
The Base of the Hill~
   You are standing at the base of a dark, slighty slopped hill.  Towards the
top against the dark horizon you see a large church protruding in the darkness.
Before the church and all along the hill is the graveyard associated with the
Christians of the area.  The population of the small town isn't great, and the
people are all vague and distant to the outsiders.    
~
