#1501
Along the Hilled Path~
   You are walking along the path on the hill that leads towards the old
church.  The path itself is an old cobblestone, but from lack of maintenence,
weeds and other things have sprouted between the stones.  Around you, you are
seeing the grave's of the citizens of this village.  There are many it seems
for such a small town.    
~
