#1502
Part of the Cemetary~
   As you walk along the paths between the nubbed down tombstones, you realize
that none of the graves have any flowers or markings on them, and the last date
of death that you see is almost 20 years prior to the current date.  All the
graves are overgrown and the tombstones themselves have vines crawling up the
sides of them.    
