#1506
The Steps Before the Church~
   A large cross dominates your view as you walk the steps into the church.  
Two statues on each side of the steps depict several scenes from the bible.  
The church itself on the outside shows signs of a large fire that burned on the
right half of it.  Two large doors block the passage forward.    
