#1507
The Church Foyer~
   Two large satanic crosses hang from the ceiling above, suspended by rusted
chains.  Rats dart back and forth, causing scratching noises on the creaky and
warped wood.  The smell of death is in here, worse than outside.  North you see
a worship altar, and closed doors welcome you to your east and west.    
~
