#1508
The Church Altar~
   Odd reddish light penetrates the stained glass windows that tower above you.
When you look up bats flutter out and some dust floats to the ground.  Parts of
the glass are broken, filled by a dark light.  Below you on the carpet is a
large satan star.  South of here is the main foyer.    
~
