#1509
The Church Library~
   This room, which once houses all of the churches bibles and different tomes,
is now gone.  From the looks of the room, it appears to have been burned from a
fire started from the inside.  Above you, shards of glass are lying
precariously on the edge of the hole in the roof, and you can also hear a faint
set of scuffling on the roof.    
~
