#1510
Church Reception Room~
   In it's better days, this room was used as a gathering hall for the members
of this particular church.  Old sofa's and tables are sprawled across the room,
with cobwebs and loads of dust on them.  Rat nests infest the old couch
coushins, along with disgusting moss.  The light filtering through the room is
bent and deformed from prisms made from crashed glass and mirrors.  To the west
is the main foyer.    
~
