#1511
A Path Down the Hill~
   The path leaves the last of the graves behind it here and starts down the
hill, falling away fast enough that the church is soon shut out of sight
behind you to the north.  A fence of grey palings leans in toward the
churchyard, and west of here the way goes on down toward the village.
~
