#1513
An Untended Orchard~
   The path runs through an orchard here, rows of old fruit trees leaning
every way but straight and their grass grown to the knee.  Fruit lies rotting
under the trees in quantities nobody has gathered, and the air is sweet and
thick with it, and with the wasps that have come to feed.
~
