#1515
A Crossroads at the Village Edge~
   The path comes out of the hedgerows onto a crossroads of packed stone.
North the way climbs back toward the church on its hill, south it runs down
into the village, and west a short track leads to a cottage with a sagging
roof.  A signpost stands at the corner, leaning hard.
