E
signpost sign post arms~
   The post carries three arms, and the paint has gone off them in long
scabs.  The arm pointing south still reads, in letters a child could cut, THE
SQUARE; the arm pointing west has lost its word entirely; and the arm to the
north has been burnt, so that only a black smear and the one word WATCH
remain of whatever it said.
~
S
#1516
A Rundown Cottage~
   The door of this cottage stands open to whoever comes, and inside there is
very little: a hearth with cold ash in it, a table scrubbed pale, and one
chair set neatly beneath the table as though someone meant to come back to
it.  A ladder goes up into the dark of the attic.
~
