#1519
The Town Square~
   The square is a wide ring of round stone, with a market cross at its
centre and the stub of a fountain beside it, dry and green with slime.
Boarded stalls stand along the eastern side, and the houses all about have
their doors shut, though you feel yourself watched from the upper windows.
~
